/-!
# Actual fibrewise Haar-mean removal

Deleting the zero Fourier frequency subtracts the original Haar mean from
the literal family series. Applied to the genuine coefficients of an
original smooth family, this gives a genuinely jointly smooth family equal
pointwise to the original function minus its fibrewise Haar integral.
Its actual zero coefficient and actual Haar mean vanish. This is an
analytic construction on the original family, not a cohomological
local-generation or base-change assertion.
-/
